Notes on third-party data:

  The annual citation counts in the journal dataset (columns Google14..Google26)
  were collected from Google Scholar; the Web of Science column derives from
  Clarivate. The citation-network and author-quality data used by parts of the
  analysis were derived from the OpenAlex and RePEc APIs. Those derived data are
  NOT redistributed in this package (they are reproducible from the public APIs
  using the accompanying code) and remain subject to their providers' terms.
